total delay (ticks)  margin to nearest data change  good frames of 100
         0                        0                          0
         1                        1                          0
         2                        2                        100   <- exactly one delay switch on
         3                        1                          0
         4                        0                          0   <- two delay switches on
         5                        1                          0
         6                        2                        100
         7                        1                          0
PHY on + MAC off = 2 ticks; PHY on + MAC on = 4 ticks; both off = 0 ticks
